{"id":"163cfc16d40fba06","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-descriptive-borel-code-tree.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive Borel Code Tree","display":"df-zfc-descriptive-borel-code-tree — ZFC Descriptive Borel Code Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive-borel-code-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive-borel-code-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive-borel-code-tree — ZFC Descriptive Borel Code Tree","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-borel]]","[[58-df-zfc-descriptive3-borel-code]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive-borel-code-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive-borel-code-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive-borel-code-tree — ZFC Descriptive Borel Code Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"58-df-borel\">58-df-borel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4a54594b19acae3d\" href=\"?note=4a54594b19acae3d\" title=\"58-df-zfc-descriptive3-borel-code\">58-df-zfc-descriptive3-borel-code</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (well-founded code tree)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> (leaf labeling map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> (a supplied topology on Baire space <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3BorelCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3BorelCode}_S\\)</span> (typed Borel-code predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4a54594b19acae3d\" href=\"?note=4a54594b19acae3d\" title=\"58-df-zfc-descriptive3-borel-code\">58-df-zfc-descriptive3-borel-code</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptiveBorelCodeTree}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptiveBorelCodeTree}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive\\text{-}borel\\text{-}code\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptiveBorelCodeTree}_S(T,c,\\tau_{\\mathcal B})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3BorelCode}_S(\\omega^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathcal B},\\langle T,c\\rangle)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive\\text{-}borel\\text{-}code\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptiveBorelCodeTree}_S(T,c,\\tau_{\\mathcal B})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3BorelCode}_S(\\omega^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathcal B},\\langle T,c\\rangle)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Internal complement/union labels and well-foundedness are supplied by the canonical typed Borel-code predicate.</li>\n<li>The topology is an explicit argument; identifying it with the standard Baire topology is a separate structure assertion rather than hidden context.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":